"Panelet 帮助、隐私与兼容性" = "Panelet Help, Privacy & Compatibility";
"独立桌面与双窗口全屏\n独立桌面长期保留，每个分区可单独使用原生全屏；临时双窗口组合在任一窗口退出全屏后结束，保留进入前已有的桌面拆分。\n\n日常操作\n默认 Control–Shift–S 打开选窗面板，Control–Shift–J 还原当前分屏。快捷键可在设置中修改。选窗时可搜索、使用方向键和回车，也可拖放窗口。选好两个窗口后可交换位置，再按回车或点击开始。\n\n收藏组合\n选好两个窗口后点击收藏。收藏只在本机保存应用标识与用于匹配的窗口标题，不保存窗口画面。使用收藏时重新查找当前窗口，不会自动启动应用；无法确定窗口时需要重新选择。删除收藏会移除该条本地记录。\n\n布局与画面\n在桌面分屏设置中选择显示器，可改为上下或左右布局，比例支持 1:1、2:1、1:2。必须先合并该屏幕才能修改。自动和清晰优先保留原生缩放并将目标帧率限制为 60 Hz；流畅优先使用 1× 画面，目标帧率最高 120 Hz，文字清晰度可能降低。实际帧率取决于系统和负载。\n\n隐私\n屏幕录制用于本机桌面合成与窗口预览，不录制音频，不上传画面。辅助功能用于选窗、移动和恢复窗口及鼠标处理。应用不包含统计上报；偏好和收藏保存在本机。恢复记录不含窗口标题或画面，正常恢复完成后删除。诊断报告由你预览、复制或导出，不会自动发送，报告排除了窗口标题、应用列表、显示器名称和文件路径。\n\n兼容性\n需要 macOS 14 或以上，以及屏幕录制、辅助功能权限和“显示器使用不同的空间”。虚拟显示器依赖系统私有接口：环境检测只能确认接口是否存在，系统更新后仍可能改变行为。受保护视频或禁止采集的窗口可能显示黑屏；HDR、广色域和高刷新率显示效果需在目标设备上验证，当前不承诺色彩校准用途。\n\n遇到问题\n菜单栏“恢复所有显示器”会结束分屏并恢复桌面，不会退出应用。部分窗口无法恢复时，可在诊断页重试。不要强制结束进程；正常退出会先合并桌面。提交问题前，可在诊断页预览脱敏报告，再自行附到问题反馈中。" = "Independent desktops and window pairs\nIndependent desktops stay active, with native full screen in each region. A temporary pair ends when either window exits full screen, preserving any pre-existing desktop split.\n\nDaily use\nControl–Shift–S opens the picker; Control–Shift–J restores the current split. Customize shortcuts in Settings. Search, use arrow keys and Return, or drag windows into regions. Select two windows, optionally swap them, then press Return or Start Split.\n\nSaved combinations\nSelect two windows and click Save. App identifiers and matching window titles are stored only on this Mac, without images. Saved combinations find currently open windows and never launch apps automatically. Choose a window if the match is ambiguous. Deleting a combination removes its local record.\n\nLayout and rendering\nChoose a display in Desktop Split settings, select top/bottom or left/right, and a 1:1, 2:1 or 1:2 ratio. Merge that display before changing its settings. Automatic and Clarity preserve native scale and target up to 60 Hz. Smoothness uses 1× resolution and targets up to 120 Hz; text may be less sharp. Actual frame rates depend on the system and load.\n\nPrivacy\nScreen Recording is used for local desktop composition and window previews. Audio is not recorded; frames are not uploaded. Accessibility is used to select, move and restore windows and route the pointer. There is no analytics upload. Preferences and saved combinations stay on this Mac. Recovery records contain no window titles or images and are removed after successful recovery. Diagnostic reports are previewed, copied or exported by you, never sent automatically. Reports exclude window titles, app lists, display names and file paths.\n\nCompatibility\nRequires macOS 14 or later, Screen Recording and Accessibility access, and “Displays have separate Spaces”. Virtual displays depend on private system interfaces. Environment checks only confirm that interfaces exist; system updates can still change their behavior. Protected video and capture-restricted windows may appear black. HDR, wide color and high-refresh rendering must be verified on target hardware; this app is not intended for color-calibrated work.\n\nTroubleshooting\nRestore All Displays ends splits and restores desktops without quitting. Retry incomplete window recovery in Diagnostics. Avoid force-quitting; normal quit merges desktops first. Preview the anonymized report in Diagnostics and attach it to an issue yourself if needed.";
